  m_Name: Cube_Material.005_0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Heat Shield
  description: The Heat Shield is a tiny, thin-flat component situated at the top-center-center
    of the engine, designed to protect surrounding components from excessive heat
    generated by the engine. Made of Material.005, its small size and strategic location
    enable it to effectively deflect heat and prevent damage to nearby components.
    Notably, the Heat Shield's material properties provide excellent thermal insulation
    and durability.
